.TH HN 1 "November 2026" "hn 0.4.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hn \- Hacker News in your terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hn
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hn
is a terminal client for
.I news.ycombinator.com
with an interactive full-screen browser, a line-oriented CLI, and JSON output for scripts and agents.
.PP
Run
.B hn
without a command to open the browser. Run
.B hn capabilities
for a machine-readable command map.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON on standard output. Also enabled by
.BR HN_JSON=1 .
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Disable ANSI color in human output. Also enabled by
.BR NO_COLOR .
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B front, new, best, ask, show, jobs
Read the main Hacker News feeds.
.TP
.B active, comments
Threads with recent activity and the latest site-wide comments.
.TP
.B past [YYYY\-MM\-DD]
Front page from a past day.
.TP
.B from \fIdomain\fR
Submissions from one domain.
.TP
.B item \fIid\fR
Show one item.
.TP
.B thread \fIid\fR
Show an item and its comment tree.
.TP
.B context \fIid\fR
Show a comment with its ancestor chain.
.TP
.B user \fIusername\fR
Show a profile and activity.
.TP
.B search \fIquery\fR
Search Hacker News through Algolia.
.TP
.B leaders, updates
Top users by karma and recently changed items.
.TP
.B login, signup, logout, whoami
Manage the saved Hacker News session.
.TP
.B vote, submit, comment, edit, delete
Authenticated write actions. These use Hacker News' HTML forms and are unofficial.
.TP
.B favorite, hide, flag, unflag
More authenticated actions.
.TP
.B drafts
List locally saved drafts. Use
.B \-\-clear
to remove them.
.TP
.B capabilities
Print the full command and JSON contract as JSON.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HN_CONFIG_DIR
Directory for the session and drafts. Default:
.IR ~/.config/hn .
.TP
.B HN_JSON
Same as
.BR \-\-json .
.TP
.B HN_PASSWORD
Password for non-interactive login. Prefer
.BR "\-\-password\-stdin" .
.TP
.B HN_SITE_URL, HN_FIREBASE_URL, HN_ALGOLIA_URL
Override the upstream base URLs for testing.
.TP
.B VISUAL, EDITOR
Editor used for interactive comments, edits, and story text.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable color.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/hn/session.json
Saved Hacker News session cookie, mode 0600. Treat it as a secret.
.TP
.I ~/.config/hn/drafts.json
Saved comment, edit, and submission drafts, mode 0600.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
hn
hn front \-\-limit 10
hn thread 8863
hn search "rust async" \-\-sort date
hn submit \-\-title "..." \-\-url https://example.com
hn front \-\-limit 5 \-\-json | jq '.entries[] | .title'
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Error. With
.BR \-\-json ,
the error is written to standard error as
.BR '{"ok":false,"error":{"code":"...","message":"..."}}' .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jq (1)
.PP
Project home page:
.IR https://github.com/kaushalvivek/hn-cli .
